      "content": "i know i should reach out but what's the point? everyone tells me it'll get better or that i'm doing a good job but they don't get it. they don't live in this house with the machines and the smells and the silence. it's just an endless cycle of watching someone fade away while i fade away too. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
